{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>《流行都市》「睇餸食飯」環節，有「三姐」蕭秀香驚喜教大家「一蠔兩煮」！分別帶來鮮甜帶辣的「蒜蓉醬辣椒蒸生蠔」，以及香麻酸辣超開胃的「酸菜麻辣浸生蠔」！兩道生蠔菜式做法簡單又惹味，大家快點買材料回家試做吧！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'><strong>蒜蓉醬辣椒蒸生蠔</strong></span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"d05b8952-34ca-499c-8c6f-12fcbd55d15c.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20268bQkB8skqG1790156583.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"d05b8952-34ca-499c-8c6f-12fcbd55d15c.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'>食材與調味</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style='padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></li><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans